	"CapCut": "剪辑",
	"CapCut is designed for quick social media edits. OpenCut AI adds professional tools: text-based editing, Smart Cut (filler + silence removal), AI dubbing in 37 languages, and AI B-roll generation.": "CapCut 专为快速社交媒体剪辑设计。OpenCut AI 添加了专业工具：基于文本的编辑、智能剪辑（去填充 + 静默去除）、37 种语言的 AI 配音和 AI B-roll 生成。",
	"CapCut is great for quick social edits — but it&apos;s owned by ByteDance (TikTok), collects extensive data, and locks AI features behind credits. OpenCut AI is": "CapCut 非常适合快速社交剪辑 — 但它属于字节跳动（抖音），收集大量数据，并将 AI 功能锁在积分后面。OpenCut AI 是",
	"CapCut is made by ByteDance (TikTok). It collects usage data, device info, and uploads content to their servers. OpenCut AI processes everything on your machine — zero data collection, zero telemetry.": "CapCut 由字节跳动（抖音）制作。它收集使用数据、设备信息并上传内容到他们的服务器。OpenCut AI 在您的设备上处理所有内容 — 零数据收集，零遥测。",
	"CapCut is owned by ByteDance (TikTok) and collects your data. OpenCut AI is open source, self-hosted, and runs 100% locally. No tracking. No data collection.": "CapCut 由字节跳动（TikTok）拥有并收集您的数据。OpenCut AI 是开源的，可自托管，并且 100% 本地运行。无跟踪，无数据收集。",
	"CapCut&apos;s AI features require credits and the free version adds watermarks. OpenCut AI is fully free with zero limitations. All features, all the time.": "CapCut 的 AI 功能需要积分，免费版会添加水印。OpenCut AI 完全免费，无任何限制。所有功能，随时可用。",
