	"Descript charges $24–65/mo and sends your media to the cloud. OpenCut AI is free, self-hosted, open source, and runs 100% locally.": "Descript 收费 $24–65/月并将你的媒体上传到云端。OpenCut AI 免费，自托管，开源，100% 本地运行。",
