	"Open-source video editor with locally processed editing tools. Commercial AI integrations are available only when licensed and enabled.": "带本地处理编辑工具的开源视频编辑器。商业 AI 集成仅在获得许可并启用时可用。",
	"open-source, self-hosted, and runs 100% locally": "开源、自主机，且100%本地运行",
	"OpenCut": "OpenCut",
	"OpenCut — the foundation": "开挖——基金会",
	"OpenCut AI": "OpenCut AI",
	"OpenCut AI is a fork of OpenCut with AI wrapped around it. Here's what's been built and what's next. (last updated: {0})": "OpenCut AI 是 OpenCut 的一个分支，并添加了 AI 功能。以下是已构建内容及接下来计划。（最后更新：{0}）",
	"OpenCut AI is open source — the code is free to use under its license. That license does not cover the name or logo. You can say you use OpenCut AI, that your project integrates with OpenCut AI, or that it was built on top of OpenCut AI. You cannot name your product OpenCut AI, imply we made or endorse your product, or use the marks commercially without asking first. For anything unclear, reach out at": "OpenCut AI 是开源的——代码在其许可下可免费使用。该许可不包括名称或徽标。你可以说你使用 OpenCut AI，你的项目与 OpenCut AI 集成，或者它是在 OpenCut AI 基础上构建的。你不能将你的产品命名为 OpenCut AI，暗示我们制作或支持你的产品，或未经许可将这些标志用于商业用途。如有不清楚之处，请联系",
	"OpenCut AI is open source and built by the community. Every contribution, no matter how small, helps us build the best free video editor possible.": "OpenCut AI 是开源的，由社区构建。每一次贡献，无论大小，都帮助我们构建最佳的免费视频编辑器。",
	"OpenCut AI is open source. If you want to contribute, fix a bug, add a feature, or just try it out, the code is there.": "OpenCut AI 是开源的。如果您想贡献、修复错误、添加功能或只是试用，代码就在这里。",
	"OpenCut AI is the browser-based, open-source alternative to DaVinci Resolve. Compare: AI transcription, text-based editing, filler word removal, AI dubbing in 37 languages, B-roll generation, karaoke subtitles. Free, self-hosted, no hardware requirements.": "OpenCut AI 是基于浏览器的开源 DaVinci Resolve 替代方案。对比功能：AI 转录、基于文本的编辑、填充词删除、37 种语言的 AI 配音、B-roll 生成、卡拉 OK 字幕。免费、自托管，无硬件要求。",
	"OpenCut AI is the free, open-source alternative to CapCut with no ByteDance data collection. Compare features: AI transcription, filler word removal, karaoke subtitles, voice cloning, B-roll generation, AI dubbing in 37 languages. Self-hosted and 100% local.": "OpenCut AI 是免费、开源的 CapCut 替代方案，不收集字节跳动数据。功能对比：AI 转录、填充词删除、卡拉 OK 字幕、语音克隆、B-roll 生成、37 种语言的 AI 配音。自托管，100% 本地。",
	"OpenCut AI is the free, open-source, self-hosted alternative to Descript. Compare features: AI transcription, text-based editing, filler word removal, voice cloning, multi-speaker detection, and 22 Indian languages. No cloud. No subscription. No data leaves your machine.": "OpenCut AI 是免费、开源、自托管的 Descript 替代方案。功能对比：AI 转录、基于文本的编辑、填充词删除、语音克隆、多说话人检测以及 22 种印度语言。无云端。无订阅。数据不离开你的设备。",
	"OpenCut AI Roadmap - What's Coming Next": "OpenCut AI 路线图——接下来会有什么功能",
	"OpenCut AI stands on the shoulders of OpenCut and the open-source community. This page tells that story.": "OpenCut AI 站在 OpenCut 和开源社区的肩膀上。本页面讲述了这个故事。",
