	"Thai": "泰语",
	"That question became OpenCut AI. A fork that wraps a complete AI suite around the OpenCut editor, adding transcription, text-based editing, voice cloning, filters, subtitles, fact-checking, and more. All open source. All local.": "这个问题发展成了 OpenCut AI。一个将完整 AI 套件围绕 OpenCut 编辑器的分支，添加了转录、基于文本的编辑、语音克隆、滤镜、字幕、事实查证等功能。全部开源。全部本地运行。",
	"The AI backend gateway powers all AI features. Start it using Docker:": "AI 后端网关驱动所有 AI 功能。使用 Docker 启动它：",
	"The AI backend is not responding. It may be starting up.": "AI 后端未响应。它可能正在启动中。",
	"The AI backend is not running. Start it to enable transcription, AI commands, and more.": "AI 后端没有运行。启动它以启用转录、AI 命令等功能。",
	"The AI layer": "AI 层",
	"The application code is distributed under the MIT License. You may use, copy, modify, and distribute it for commercial purposes, provided that the copyright and permission notice remain with copies of the software.": "应用程序代码在 MIT 许可证下分发。只要版权和许可声明保留在软件副本中，您可以将其用于商业用途，包括使用、复制、修改和分发。",
	"The editor code is MIT licensed; models, providers, and media have separate terms.": "编辑器代码基于 MIT 许可证；模型、提供商和媒体有各自的条款。",
	"The editor runs approved models locally on your machine for maximum privacy and speed. Let&apos;s detect your hardware to find the best configuration.": "编辑器在您的本地机器上运行经过批准的模型，以实现最大隐私和速度。让我们检测您的硬件以找到最佳配置。",
	"The foundation": "基础",
	"The full lockup combines the symbol and wordmark. Prefer this in most contexts where you have enough horizontal space.": "完整锁定组合了符号和文字标识。在大多数有足够水平空间的情况下优先使用此组合。",
	"The media file could not be read for transcription.": "媒体文件无法读取以进行转录。",
	"The MIT code may be used commercially when its copyright and license notice are retained": "在保留版权和许可声明的情况下，可将 MIT 代码用于商业用途",
	"The MIT License does not grant rights to third-party trademarks, product names, logos, models, training data, stock media, or cloud services.": "MIT 许可证不授予第三方商标、产品名称、标识、模型、训练数据、素材媒体或云服务的权利。",
	"The only privacy-first, open-source, self-hosted, AI-powered video editor. See how OpenCut AI compares to Descript, CapCut, and DaVinci Resolve.": "唯一以隐私为优先的、开源、自托管、AI 驱动的视频编辑器。了解 OpenCut AI 与 Descript、CapCut 和 DaVinci Resolve 的对比。",
	"The open-source ecosystem": "开源生态系统",
	"The question was simple: what if you could edit a video by editing its transcript? What if AI could transcribe, translate, clone voices, generate visuals, and fact-check claims, all running on your own machine with no cloud dependency?": "问题很简单：如果你可以通过编辑转录文本来编辑视频会怎样？如果 AI 可以进行转录、翻译、克隆声音、生成视觉内容并验证信息，而且全部都在你自己的设备上运行，无需云依赖，会怎样？",
	"The software is provided as-is without warranties": "本软件按原样提供，不提供任何保证",
	"The software is provided as-is, without warranties, to the maximum extent permitted by law. These engineering safeguards are not legal advice. Have qualified counsel review your deployment before offering it commercially.": "在法律允许的最大范围内，本软件按原样提供，不提供任何保证。这些工程保障不构成法律建议。请在商业提供前由合格律师审查您的部署。",
	"The tools and models powering OpenCut AI": "支持 OpenCut AI 的工具和模型",
