	"Transitions library": "过渡库",
	"Translate and re-voice video into 17 languages. A dedicated NLLB-200 translate-service runs fully on-device for the 'Local' engine — translation text never leaves the host. Combined with voice-cloned XTTS v2 for the privacy-first dubbing path. Cloud engines (Sarvam, Smallest) remain available as alternatives.": "将视频翻译并重新配音成17种语言。为“本地”引擎专门运行的NLLB-200翻译服务全程在设备上运行——翻译文本不会离开主机。结合语音克隆XTTS v2，用于隐私优先的配音路径。云端引擎（Sarvam、Smallest）仍可作为替代。",
	"Translate captions into multiple languages at once via the local NLLB-200 service, with one subtitle track per language and per-language SRT/VTT export. Falls back to Sarvam or the local LLM per language when NLLB is unavailable. No data-model change — reuses the existing translation + subtitle-track infrastructure.": "通过本地NLLB-200服务一次将字幕翻译成多种语言，每种语言一条字幕轨道，并支持按语言导出SRT/VTT。当NLLB不可用时，按语言回退至Sarvam或本地LLM。无需更改数据模型——复用现有的翻译和字幕轨道基础设施。",
	"Translate locally with NLLB-200, with Sarvam AI or local LLM fallback when needed.": "使用 NLLB-200 本地翻译，如有需要可回退到 Sarvam AI 或本地 LLM。",
	"Translate to English": "翻译为英语",
