	"CapCut": "剪輯",
	"CapCut is designed for quick social media edits. OpenCut AI adds professional tools: text-based editing, Smart Cut (filler + silence removal), AI dubbing in 37 languages, and AI B-roll generation.": "CapCut 專為快速社群媒體剪輯設計。OpenCut AI 添加專業工具：文字編輯、智能剪切（填充 + 靜音去除）、37 種語言的 AI 配音，以及 AI B-roll 生成。",
	"CapCut is great for quick social edits — but it&apos;s owned by ByteDance (TikTok), collects extensive data, and locks AI features behind credits. OpenCut AI is": "CapCut 非常適合快速社群剪輯 — 但它由 ByteDance（抖音）擁有，收集大量資料，並將 AI 功能鎖在點數後面。OpenCut AI 是",
	"CapCut is made by ByteDance (TikTok). It collects usage data, device info, and uploads content to their servers. OpenCut AI processes everything on your machine — zero data collection, zero telemetry.": "CapCut 由 ByteDance（抖音）製作。它收集使用資料、設備資訊，並上傳內容到其伺服器。OpenCut AI 在您的機器上處理所有內容 — 零資料收集，零遙測。",
	"CapCut is owned by ByteDance (TikTok) and collects your data. OpenCut AI is open source, self-hosted, and runs 100% locally. No tracking. No data collection.": "CapCut 屬於字節跳動 (TikTok) 並會收集你的數據。OpenCut AI 是開源、自行託管，並且完全在本地運行。無追蹤。無數據收集。",
	"CapCut&apos;s AI features require credits and the free version adds watermarks. OpenCut AI is fully free with zero limitations. All features, all the time.": "CapCut 的 AI 功能需要積分，而免費版本會添加浮水印。OpenCut AI 完全免費，無任何限制。所有功能，隨時使用。",
