	"Descript charges $24–65/mo and sends your media to the cloud. OpenCut AI is free, self-hosted, open source, and runs 100% locally.": "Descript 收費 $24–65/月，並將你的媒體上傳至雲端。OpenCut AI 免費、自行托管、開源，且完全在本地運行。",
