	"Open-source video editor with locally processed editing tools. Commercial AI integrations are available only when licensed and enabled.": "具本地處理編輯工具的開源影片編輯器。商業 AI 整合僅在取得授權並啟用後可用。",
	"open-source, self-hosted, and runs 100% locally": "開源、自架，且 100% 本地運行",
	"OpenCut": "OpenCut",
	"OpenCut — the foundation": "OpenCut — 基金會",
	"OpenCut AI": "OpenCut AI",
	"OpenCut AI is a fork of OpenCut with AI wrapped around it. Here's what's been built and what's next. (last updated: {0})": "OpenCut AI 是 OpenCut 的分支，並包覆了 AI 的架構。以下是已開發的內容以及接下來的發展。（最後更新：{0}）",
	"OpenCut AI is open source — the code is free to use under its license. That license does not cover the name or logo. You can say you use OpenCut AI, that your project integrates with OpenCut AI, or that it was built on top of OpenCut AI. You cannot name your product OpenCut AI, imply we made or endorse your product, or use the marks commercially without asking first. For anything unclear, reach out at": "OpenCut AI 是開源的——在其許可下，程式碼可以免費使用。該許可不涵蓋名稱或標誌。你可以說你使用 OpenCut AI，你的專案與 OpenCut AI 整合，或者它是建立在 OpenCut AI 之上。你不能將你的產品命名為 OpenCut AI，暗示我們製作或支持你的產品，或未經允許商業使用標誌。如有任何不清楚之處，請聯絡",
	"OpenCut AI is open source and built by the community. Every contribution, no matter how small, helps us build the best free video editor possible.": "OpenCut AI 是開源的，由社群打造。每一份貢獻，不論多微小，都幫助我們打造出最優質的免費影片編輯器。",
	"OpenCut AI is open source. If you want to contribute, fix a bug, add a feature, or just try it out, the code is there.": "OpenCut AI 是開源的。如果你想貢獻、修正錯誤、新增功能，或只是試用，程式碼都在那裡。",
	"OpenCut AI is the browser-based, open-source alternative to DaVinci Resolve. Compare: AI transcription, text-based editing, filler word removal, AI dubbing in 37 languages, B-roll generation, karaoke subtitles. Free, self-hosted, no hardware requirements.": "OpenCut AI 是瀏覽器為基礎的開源替代方案，用於替代 DaVinci Resolve。功能比較：AI 轉錄、文字編輯、填充詞去除、37 種語言的 AI 配音、B-roll 生成、卡拉 OK 字幕。免費、自行託管，無硬體要求。",
	"OpenCut AI is the free, open-source alternative to CapCut with no ByteDance data collection. Compare features: AI transcription, filler word removal, karaoke subtitles, voice cloning, B-roll generation, AI dubbing in 37 languages. Self-hosted and 100% local.": "OpenCut AI 是免費、開源的 CapCut 替代方案，且無字節跳動數據收集。功能比較：AI 轉錄、填充詞去除、卡拉 OK 字幕、語音克隆、B-roll 生成、37 種語言的 AI 配音。自主管理並 100% 本地化。",
	"OpenCut AI is the free, open-source, self-hosted alternative to Descript. Compare features: AI transcription, text-based editing, filler word removal, voice cloning, multi-speaker detection, and 22 Indian languages. No cloud. No subscription. No data leaves your machine.": "OpenCut AI 是免費、開源、自行託管的 Descript 替代方案。功能比較：AI 轉錄、文字編輯、填充詞去除、語音克隆、多說話者偵測以及 22 種印度語言。無雲端。無訂閱。數據不外傳。",
	"OpenCut AI Roadmap - What's Coming Next": "OpenCut AI 路線圖——未來規劃",
	"OpenCut AI stands on the shoulders of OpenCut and the open-source community. This page tells that story.": "OpenCut AI 站在 OpenCut 與開源社群的肩膀上。這個頁面講述了這個故事。",
