	"Thai": "泰語",
	"That question became OpenCut AI. A fork that wraps a complete AI suite around the OpenCut editor, adding transcription, text-based editing, voice cloning, filters, subtitles, fact-checking, and more. All open source. All local.": "那個問題變成了 OpenCut AI。一個圍繞 OpenCut 編輯器建立完整 AI 套件的分支，增加了轉錄、基於文字的編輯、語音克隆、濾鏡、字幕、事實核查等功能。全部開源。全部在本地運行。",
	"The AI backend gateway powers all AI features. Start it using Docker:": "AI 後端閘道為所有 AI 功能提供動力。使用 Docker 啟動它：",
	"The AI backend is not responding. It may be starting up.": "AI 後端未回應。它可能正在啟動中。",
	"The AI backend is not running. Start it to enable transcription, AI commands, and more.": "AI 後端未運行。啟動它以啟用轉錄、AI 指令等功能。",
	"The AI layer": "AI 層",
	"The application code is distributed under the MIT License. You may use, copy, modify, and distribute it for commercial purposes, provided that the copyright and permission notice remain with copies of the software.": "應用程式程式碼依 MIT 授權發布。您可以在保留版權及授權聲明的前提下，用於商業目的，包括使用、複製、修改及分發該程式碼。",
	"The editor code is MIT licensed; models, providers, and media have separate terms.": "編輯器程式碼為 MIT 授權；模型、提供者及媒體有單獨條款。",
	"The editor runs approved models locally on your machine for maximum privacy and speed. Let&apos;s detect your hardware to find the best configuration.": "編輯器在你的本機上運行經核准的模型，以達到最大隱私及速度。我們來檢測你的硬體以找到最佳配置。",
	"The foundation": "基礎",
	"The full lockup combines the symbol and wordmark. Prefer this in most contexts where you have enough horizontal space.": "完整鎖定組合包括符號和文字標誌。在大多數有足夠水平空間的情況下推薦使用此版本。",
	"The media file could not be read for transcription.": "無法讀取媒體檔案進行轉錄。",
	"The MIT code may be used commercially when its copyright and license notice are retained": "保留其版權及授權聲明後，MIT 程式碼可用於商業用途",
	"The MIT License does not grant rights to third-party trademarks, product names, logos, models, training data, stock media, or cloud services.": "MIT 授權不授予第三方商標、產品名稱、標誌、模型、訓練資料、素材媒體或雲端服務的權利。",
	"The only privacy-first, open-source, self-hosted, AI-powered video editor. See how OpenCut AI compares to Descript, CapCut, and DaVinci Resolve.": "唯一注重隱私、開源、自行托管、由 AI 驅動的影片編輯器。查看 OpenCut AI 與 Descript、CapCut 和 DaVinci Resolve 的比較。",
	"The open-source ecosystem": "開源生態系統",
	"The question was simple: what if you could edit a video by editing its transcript? What if AI could transcribe, translate, clone voices, generate visuals, and fact-check claims, all running on your own machine with no cloud dependency?": "問題很簡單：如果你可以透過編輯文字稿來編輯影片會怎樣？如果 AI 可以轉錄、翻譯、克隆語音、生成視覺效果並核查事實，而且全部在你自己的電腦上運作，無需依賴雲端服務呢？",
	"The software is provided as-is without warranties": "該軟體按原樣提供，並不附帶保證",
	"The software is provided as-is, without warranties, to the maximum extent permitted by law. These engineering safeguards are not legal advice. Have qualified counsel review your deployment before offering it commercially.": "該軟體按原樣提供，在法律允許的最大範圍內不附帶任何保證。這些工程保障措施不構成法律建議。在商業提供之前，請由合格律師審查您的部署。",
	"The tools and models powering OpenCut AI": "為 OpenCut AI 提供動力的工具和模型",
	"Thinking...": "思考中…",
	"This deployment may include optional analytics scripts configured by the site operator. Consult the operator's production privacy notice for its actual configuration.": "此部署可能包含由網站操作員配置的可選分析腳本。請查閱操作員的生產隱私通知以了解其實際配置。",
