	"Transcribe your video first using the Transcript tab, then come back here to create podcast-style clips.": "首先使用「抄錄」標籤抄錄你的影片，然後再回到這裡創建播客風格的片段。",
	"Transcribe your video to edit it like a document. Delete sections, remove filler words, or reorder segments.": "抄錄你的影片以像編輯文件一樣編輯它。刪除片段、移除填充詞或重新排序段落。",
