	"Transcribe your video, then edit it like a document. Delete a sentence and the video cuts itself. Drag to reorder scenes.": "抄錄你的影片，然後像編輯文件一樣編輯它。刪除一句話，影片自動裁剪。拖曳以重新排序場景。",
