	"Transitions library": "過場特效庫",
	"Translate and re-voice video into 17 languages. A dedicated NLLB-200 translate-service runs fully on-device for the 'Local' engine — translation text never leaves the host. Combined with voice-cloned XTTS v2 for the privacy-first dubbing path. Cloud engines (Sarvam, Smallest) remain available as alternatives.": "將影片翻譯並重新配音為17種語言。專用的 NLLB-200 翻譯服務在“本地”引擎上完全運行 — 翻譯文字永不離開主機。結合語音克隆的 XTTS v2，實現以隱私為先的配音流程。雲端引擎（Sarvam、Smallest）仍可作為替代選項。",
	"Translate captions into multiple languages at once via the local NLLB-200 service, with one subtitle track per language and per-language SRT/VTT export. Falls back to Sarvam or the local LLM per language when NLLB is unavailable. No data-model change — reuses the existing translation + subtitle-track infrastructure.": "通過本地 NLLB-200 服務一次將字幕翻譯成多種語言，每種語言一條字幕軌，可以匯出為該語言的 SRT/VTT 格式。當 NLLB 無法使用時，將依每種語言回退到 Sarvam 或本地 LLM。無數據模型變更 — 重用現有的翻譯 + 字幕軌基礎設施。",
	"Translate locally with NLLB-200, with Sarvam AI or local LLM fallback when needed.": "使用 NLLB-200 本地翻譯，必要時可使用 Sarvam AI 或本地 LLM 作備援。",
	"Translate to English": "翻譯成英文",
	"Translates transcript segments and generates speech in the target language. Each dubbed segment is placed as a new audio track aligned to the original timestamps.": "翻譯轉錄片段並生成目標語言語音。每個配音片段作為新音軌，對齊原始時間戳。",
